#Traffic light program: Write a program that takes the color of the traffic light as input from the user and prints whether to "Stop", "Get Ready", or "Go" based on the color input (Red, Yellow, Green).

traffic_light_color = str(input("Enter the color of the traffic light (Red, Yellow, Green): "))
if(traffic_light_color == "Red"):
    print("Stop")
elif(traffic_light_color == "Yellow"):
        print("Get Ready")
elif(traffic_light_color == "Green"):
        print("Go")
else:
            print("Invalid color input. Please enter Red, Yellow, or Green.")
#End of Practice Program 5


